--TEST--
A `mixed` value converted with `as array<mixed>` is a `foreach` subject, and its keys are `tainted string` — `rule:iteration/foreach-subjects`
--FILE--
<?nvs
mixed $m = ["a" => 1, "b" => 2];
foreach (($m as array<mixed>) as tainted string $k => mixed $v) {
    echo $k, "=", $v as string, ";";
}
echo "\n";
--EXPECT--
a=1;b=2;
